        "created_at": "2013-04-05T15:42:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sounds great.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Biggest risk I see is that there are a few unanswered questions out there that need rulings, and I fear some arguments getting started if players feel they really have something to lose if a ruling goes against them.</p>",
